  deterministic null for zero-size allocation, zeroed allocation, and resize
  with old-allocation preservation on exhaustion. Every public heap mutation
  preflights the entire canonical chain. Invalid later metadata rejects before
  earlier state or result publication changes.
- Implemented byte-stream evidence: profile input words `0..255` map to C byte
  values, profile EOF `4,782,968` maps to `-1`, impossible intermediate words
